From the repository root, pass `--dest-dir .artifacts/tmp/OWNED/book` to
`mdbook build docs/book`. The CLI destination resolves against the invocation
working directory. Do not prepend `../../../` as if it were book-relative.
The selected render demonstrated that error; its exact newly created output
was copied into the repository, byte-verified, inspected and removed. The
original output was also removed after verified relocation. The saved audit
checks the retained evidence and absence; it does not rebuild or repeat cleanup.
